       IDENTIFICATION DIVISION.
      ******************************************************************
      *           I D E N T I F I C A T I O N   D I V I S I O N        *
      ******************************************************************
      * PROGRAM NAME
      ******************************************************************
       PROGRAM-ID. SWB4827.
      ******************************************************************
      *                                                                *
      *                      - MENSAGENS SWIFT -                       *
      *                                                                *
      ******************************************************************
      * RECONCILIAÇÃO AUTOMÁTICA DE OPERAÇÕES estornadas/anuladas      *
      *                                                                *
      *                               |1|2|3|4|5|6|7|8|9|A|N|          *
      *     Níveis de reconciliação:  | | | | | | | | | | |x|          *
      *                                                                *
      ******************************************************************
      *           L O G     D E     A L T E R A C O E S                *
      ******************************************************************
      *  INICIO  * AUTOR  * FIM    *  C O M E N T A R I O S            *
      *          *        *        *                                   *
      *          *        *        *                                   *
      ******************************************************************
       ENVIRONMENT DIVISION.
      ******************************************************************
      *           E N V I R O N M E N T         D I V I S I O N        *
      ******************************************************************
       CONFIGURATION SECTION.
      ******************************************************************
      *                     CONFIGURATION SECTION                      *
      ******************************************************************
       SOURCE-COMPUTER. IBM-AS400.
       OBJECT-COMPUTER. IBM-AS400.
       SPECIAL-NAMES.
           DECIMAL-POINT IS COMMA.
      ******************************************************************
       INPUT-OUTPUT SECTION.
      ******************************************************************
      *                      INPUT-OUTPUT SECTION                      *
      ******************************************************************
       FILE-CONTROL.
      ******************************************************************
       DATA DIVISION.
      ******************************************************************
      *                   D A T A   D I V I S I O N                    *
      ******************************************************************
       FILE SECTION.
      ******************************************************************
      *                          FILE SECTION                          *
      ******************************************************************
       WORKING-STORAGE SECTION.
      ******************************************************************
      *                    WORKING STORAGE SECTION                     *
      ******************************************************************
       01  FILLER                          PIC X(40) VALUE
                                               'INICIO WORKING-STORAGE'.
      ******************************************************************
      * PROGRAM CONTROL
      ******************************************************************
       01  WS-PROGRAM-CONTROL.
           05 WS-PROGNAME                  PIC  X(10) VALUE 'SWB4827'.

      ******************************************************************
      * TABELAS
      ******************************************************************
           EXEC SQL INCLUDE SWCD7204 END-EXEC.
           EXEC SQL INCLUDE SWCD8201 END-EXEC.

       01  DCLSWPARAM.
           COPY DDS-ALL-FORMATS OF SWPARAM  PREFIX BY 'SWPARAM-'.

      ******************************************************************
      * APIS
      ******************************************************************
           COPY AQCK0001.
           COPY AQCW0109.
           COPY VIAW0011.

      ******************************************************************
      * APIS
      ******************************************************************
           COPY SXCL0002.
           COPY SXCL0445.
           COPY ETCL1000.
           COPY ETCL9203.
           COPY ARCL5072.

      ******************************************************************
      * CONSTANTES
      ******************************************************************
       01  WS-CONSTANTES.
           05 CON-SWVT7204                 PIC  X(08) VALUE 'SWVT7204'.
           05 CON-SWVT8201                 PIC  X(08) VALUE 'SWVT8201'.
           05 CON-SWPARAM                  PIC  X(08) VALUE 'SWPARAM'.
           05 CON-NAO                      PIC  X(01) VALUE 'N'.
           05 CON-PEND                     PIC  X(02) VALUE 'PD'.
           05 CON-RECONC                   PIC  X(02) VALUE 'RC'.
           05 CON-RECONC-PROP              PIC  X(02) VALUE 'RS'.
           05 CON-AUTOMATICA               PIC  X(01) VALUE 'A'.
           05 CON-MANUAL                   PIC  X(01) VALUE 'M'.
           05 CON-ON0                      PIC  X(03) VALUE 'ON0'.
           05 CON-INACTNIV                 PIC  X(10) VALUE 'INACTNIV'.

      ******************************************************************
      * VARIAVEIS
      ******************************************************************
       01 WS-VARIAVEIS.
           05 WS-SWT72-MRBALC              PIC S9(04)       COMP-3.
           05 WS-SWT72-MRCCB               PIC  X(13)             .
           05 WS-SWT72-MRNOPR              PIC S9(09)       COMP-3.
           05 WS-SWT72-MRNORD              PIC S9(07)       COMP-3.
           05 WS-SWT72-MRVLR               PIC S9(13)V9(02) COMP-3.
           05 WS-SWT72-IRECONC             PIC  X(01).
           05 WS-SWT72-MREANL              PIC  X(01).

           05 WS-PRPARAM                   PIC  X(10).
           05 FILLER REDEFINES WS-PRPARAM.
              10 WS-CBAN                   PIC  X(04).
              10 WS-CSPAI                  PIC  X(02).
              10 WS-CMOED                  PIC  X(03).
              10 FILLER                    PIC  X(01).
           05 WS-PRVALBOL                  PIC  X(01).

           05 WS-CCODEST                   PIC  X(02).

           05 WS-TOTAL                     PIC S9(15)V9(02) COMP-3.
           05 WS-COUNT                     PIC S9(10)       COMP-3.
           05 WS-TOTAL-MOVIM               PIC S9(15)V9(02) COMP-3.
           05 WS-COUNT-MOVIM               PIC S9(10)       COMP-3.
           05 WS-TOTAL-EXTR                PIC S9(15)V9(02) COMP-3.
           05 WS-COUNT-EXTR                PIC S9(10)       COMP-3.

           05 WS-CCHAVE                    PIC  X(30).
PML        05 WS-IDREC                     PIC S9(13)       COMP-3.
 |         05 WS-IDRECONC                  PIC  X(13).
 |         05 FILLER REDEFINES WS-IDRECONC.
 |            10 WS-IDRECONC-DATA          PIC  X(06).
PML           10 WS-IDRECONC-SEQ           PIC  9(07).

           05 WS-DTRECONC                  PIC  9(08).
           05 FILLER REDEFINES WS-DTRECONC.
              10 FILLER                    PIC  X(02).
              10 WS-DTRECONC-ANT           PIC  X(06).
PML        05 WS-IDRECONC-INIC             PIC  9(13).
           05 WS-TOTAL-RECONC              PIC  9(13).

           05 WS-COMMIT-LIMIT              PIC S9(09)       COMP.
           05 WS-COMMIT-COUNT              PIC S9(09)       COMP.

           05 WS-INACTIV                   PIC  X(35).
           05 WS-TALLY                     PIC  9(02).

      ******************************************************************
      * SWITCHES
      ******************************************************************
       01  WS-SWITCHES.
           05 WS-CURSOR-STATE              PIC S9(03)       COMP-3.
              88 WS-CURSOR-OK                         VALUE  0.
              88 WS-CURSOR-END                        VALUE -1.

           05 SW-PRVALBOL-STATUS           PIC  X(01).
              88 SW-PRVALBOL-OK                       VALUE 'S'.
              88 SW-PRVALBOL-NOTOK                    VALUE 'N'.

           05 SW-RECONC-STATE              PIC S9(03)       COMP-3.
              88 SW-RECONC-OPER-NAO                   VALUE  0.
              88 SW-RECONC-OPER                       VALUE -1.

           05 SW-SELECT-STATUS             PIC  X(01).
              88 SW-SELECT-OK                         VALUE 'S'.
              88 SW-SELECT-NOTOK                      VALUE 'N'.

           05 SW-NIVEL-RECONCILIACAO       PIC  X(02).
              88 SW-NIVEL-11                          VALUE '11'.

           05 SW-INACT11                   PIC  9(01).
              88 SW-INACT11-N                         VALUE 0.
              88 SW-INACT11-S                         VALUE 1.

      ******************************************************************
      * COPYS
      ******************************************************************
           COPY VIAW0030.
           COPY VIAL0015.
           COPY VIAL0030.

      *    COPY AQCW0009.
           COPY AQCW0011.

           COPY SWCK0001.
           COPY SWCK0002.

      ******************************************************************
      * DB2
      ******************************************************************
           EXEC SQL INCLUDE SQLCA    END-EXEC.

           EXEC SQL
                DECLARE CRS_SWVT72 CURSOR WITH HOLD FOR
                 SELECT MRBALC
                      , MRCCB
                      , NCCCCBAN
                      , NCCCCSPAI
                      , MRVLR
                      , MRDATL
                      , MRNOPR
                      , MRNORD
                      , MREANL
                      , MRMOED
                   FROM SWVT7204
PML24             WHERE CCODEST = :CON-PEND
                    AND MREANL <> :SWCD7204-MREANL
                  ORDER
                     BY MRDATL
                      , MRNOPR
                      , MRNORD
           END-EXEC.

      ******************************************************************
       01  FILLER                          PIC X(40) VALUE
                                               'FIM DA WORKING-STORAGE'.
      ******************************************************************
       LINKAGE SECTION.
           COPY AQCW0009.

      ******************************************************************
       PROCEDURE DIVISION USING AQCW0009-DATA.

      ******************************************************************
      *              P R O C E D U R E   D I V I S I O N               *
      ******************************************************************
       0000-MAINLINE.
      ******************************************************************
           PERFORM 1000-INICIO-PROGRAMA
              THRU 1000-INICIO-PROGRAMA-EXIT.

           IF AQCW0009-SEM-ERROS AND SW-INACT11-N
              PERFORM 2000-PROC-PROGRAMA
                 THRU 2000-PROC-PROGRAMA-EXIT
           END-IF.

           PERFORM 3000-FIM-PROGRAMA
              THRU 3000-FIM-PROGRAMA-EXIT.

       0000-MAINLINE-EXIT.
           GOBACK.

      ******************************************************************
       1000-INICIO-PROGRAMA.
      ******************************************************************
           INITIALIZE WS-VARIAVEIS.
           INITIALIZE WS-SWITCHES.

           SET AQCW0009-RCODE-OK       TO TRUE.

AG    *    CALL 'TRETAS'.

           PERFORM AQCP0100-REG-INICIO
              THRU AQCP0100-REG-INICIO-EXIT.

           IF AQCW0009-SEM-ERROS
              PERFORM AQCP0100-OBT-DADOS-ARQ
                 THRU AQCP0100-OBT-DADOS-ARQ-EXIT
           END-IF.

           IF AQCW0009-SEM-ERROS
              PERFORM 8000-GET-COMMIT
                 THRU 8099-GET-COMMIT-EXIT
           END-IF.

           MOVE AQCW0100-AT-DEBUG          TO VIAL0015-I-DEBUG.

           IF AQCW0009-SEM-ERROS
              PERFORM 1100-OBTEM-SEQ-RECONC
                 THRU 1100-OBTEM-SEQ-RECONC-EXIT

              IF AQCW0009-SEM-ERROS
                 MOVE WS-IDRECONC          TO WS-IDRECONC-INIC
              END-IF
           END-IF.

           IF AQCW0009-SEM-ERROS
              PERFORM 1200-OBTEM-INACTIV
                 THRU 1200-OBTEM-INACTIV-EXIT
           END-IF.

       1000-INICIO-PROGRAMA-EXIT.
           EXIT.

      ******************************************************************
       1100-OBTEM-SEQ-RECONC.
      ******************************************************************
           MOVE '1100-OBTEM-SEQ-RECONC'    TO VIAL0015-CALLER-ID.
           IF AQCW0100-AT-DEBUG-SIM
              PERFORM VIAP0015-TRATA-DEBUG
                 THRU VIAP0015-TRATA-DEBUG-EXIT
           END-IF.

           MOVE AQCW0100-AT-DTOP           TO WS-DTRECONC

           PERFORM 1110-SOMA-SEQ-RECONC
              THRU 1110-SOMA-SEQ-RECONC-EXIT.

           IF AQCW0009-SEM-ERROS
PML           MOVE VIAL0030-NSEQUEN-1(5:13) TO WS-IDRECONC
           END-IF.

           EVALUATE TRUE
AG            WHEN NOT AQCW0009-SEM-ERROS
              WHEN WS-IDRECONC-DATA EQUAL WS-DTRECONC-ANT
                 CONTINUE
              WHEN OTHER
PML              MOVE WS-DTRECONC(3:6)     TO WS-IDRECONC-DATA
PML              MOVE 1                    TO WS-IDRECONC-SEQ
                 PERFORM 1120-FORCA-SEQ-RECONC
                    THRU 1120-FORCA-SEQ-RECONC-EXIT
           END-EVALUATE.

       1100-OBTEM-SEQ-RECONC-EXIT.
           EXIT.

      ******************************************************************
       1110-SOMA-SEQ-RECONC.
      ******************************************************************
           MOVE '1110-SOMA-SEQ-RECONC'     TO VIAL0015-CALLER-ID.
           IF AQCW0100-AT-DEBUG-SIM
              PERFORM VIAP0015-TRATA-DEBUG
                 THRU VIAP0015-TRATA-DEBUG-EXIT
           END-IF.

           MOVE SWCK0002-CSEQ-ID-RECONC    TO VIAL0030-CSEQUEN.
           SET  VIAL0030-SOMA-1            TO TRUE.

PML   * VIAR0030
           CALL VIAL0030-ROTINA-SEQ
              USING ETCL0002-COMMAREA
                    VIAL0030-COMMAREA
           END-CALL.

           EVALUATE TRUE
              WHEN ETCL0002-SEM-ERROS
                 CONTINUE
              WHEN OTHER
                 SET  AQCW0009-RCODE-APL   TO TRUE
                 MOVE WS-PROGNAME          TO VIAW0030-PGMNAME
                 MOVE VIAL0015-CALLER-ID   TO VIAW0030-PARAGRAPH-NAME
                 MOVE AQCW0011-TABLE-NAME  TO VIAW0030-TABLE-NAME
                 MOVE AQCW0011-SQLCODE     TO VIAW0030-SQLCODE
                 MOVE 'ERRO NO SOMA SEQ'   TO VIAW0030-DESC1
                 PERFORM VIAP0030-ESCREVE-SPOOL
                    THRU VIAP0030-ESCREVE-SPOOL-EXIT
           END-EVALUATE.

       1110-SOMA-SEQ-RECONC-EXIT.
           EXIT.

      ******************************************************************
       1120-FORCA-SEQ-RECONC.
      ******************************************************************
           MOVE '1120-FORCA-SEQ-RECONC '   TO VIAL0015-CALLER-ID.
           IF AQCW0100-AT-DEBUG-SIM
              PERFORM VIAP0015-TRATA-DEBUG
                 THRU VIAP0015-TRATA-DEBUG-EXIT
           END-IF.

           MOVE SWCK0002-CSEQ-ID-RECONC    TO VIAL0030-CSEQUEN.
           SET  VIAL0030-FORCA-VALOR       TO TRUE.

           MOVE WS-IDRECONC                TO VIAL0030-VALOR-ACUM.

PML   * VIAR0031
           CALL VIAL0030-ROTINA-SEQ
              USING ETCL0002-COMMAREA
                    VIAL0030-COMMAREA
           END-CALL.

           EVALUATE TRUE
              WHEN ETCL0002-SEM-ERROS
                 CONTINUE
              WHEN OTHER
                 SET  AQCW0009-RCODE-APL   TO TRUE
                 MOVE WS-PROGNAME          TO VIAW0030-PGMNAME
                 MOVE VIAL0015-CALLER-ID   TO VIAW0030-PARAGRAPH-NAME
                 MOVE AQCW0011-TABLE-NAME  TO VIAW0030-TABLE-NAME
                 MOVE AQCW0011-SQLCODE     TO VIAW0030-SQLCODE
                 MOVE 'ERRO NO FORCA SEQ'  TO VIAW0030-DESC1
                 PERFORM VIAP0030-ESCREVE-SPOOL
                    THRU VIAP0030-ESCREVE-SPOOL-EXIT
           END-EVALUATE.

       1120-FORCA-SEQ-RECONC-EXIT.
           EXIT.

      ******************************************************************
       1200-OBTEM-INACTIV.
      ******************************************************************
           MOVE '1200-OBTEM-INACTIV'         TO VIAL0015-CALLER-ID
           IF AQCW0100-AT-DEBUG-SIM
              PERFORM VIAP0015-TRATA-DEBUG
                 THRU VIAP0015-TRATA-DEBUG-EXIT
           END-IF.

           INITIALIZE DCLSWPARAM           REPLACING NUMERIC BY ZEROES
                                                ALPHANUMERIC BY SPACES.

           MOVE SWCK0002-CAPLIC            TO SWPARAM-PRCODPAR.
           MOVE CON-INACTNIV               TO SWPARAM-PRPARAM.

           EXEC SQL
              SELECT PRVALALF
                INTO :SWPARAM-PRVALALF
                FROM SWPARAM
               WHERE PRCODPAR  =  :SWPARAM-PRCODPAR
                 AND PRPARAM   =  :SWPARAM-PRPARAM
           END-EXEC.

           MOVE CON-SWPARAM                TO AQCW0011-TABLE-NAME.

           PERFORM 9020-DB2CHECK
              THRU 9029-DB2CHECK-EXIT.

           EVALUATE TRUE
              WHEN AQCW0011-OK
                 MOVE SWPARAM-PRVALALF     TO WS-INACTIV
              WHEN AQCW0011-NOTFND
                 MOVE SPACES               TO WS-INACTIV
              WHEN OTHER
                 SET  AQCW0009-RCODE-APL
                      VIAW0030-DB2-ERROR   TO TRUE
                 MOVE WS-PROGNAME          TO VIAW0030-PGMNAME
                 MOVE VIAL0015-CALLER-ID   TO VIAW0030-PARAGRAPH-NAME
                 MOVE AQCW0011-TABLE-NAME  TO VIAW0030-TABLE-NAME
                 MOVE AQCW0011-SQLCODE     TO VIAW0030-SQLCODE
                 MOVE 'Erro INACTIV'       TO VIAW0030-DESC1
                 PERFORM VIAP0030-ESCREVE-SPOOL
                    THRU VIAP0030-ESCREVE-SPOOL-EXIT
           END-EVALUATE.

           IF AQCW0009-SEM-ERROS
              PERFORM 1210-PROC-INACTIV
                 THRU 1210-PROC-INACTIV-EXIT
           END-IF.

       1200-OBTEM-INACTIV-EXIT.
           EXIT.

      ******************************************************************
       1210-PROC-INACTIV.
      ******************************************************************
           MOVE '1210-PROC-INACTIV'       TO VIAL0015-CALLER-ID.
           IF AQCW0100-AT-DEBUG-SIM
              PERFORM VIAP0015-TRATA-DEBUG
                 THRU VIAP0015-TRATA-DEBUG-EXIT
           END-IF.

           MOVE ZERO TO WS-TALLY.
           INSPECT WS-INACTIV TALLYING WS-TALLY FOR ALL 'N'.
           IF WS-TALLY > 0
              SET SW-INACT11-S             TO TRUE
           END-IF.

       1210-PROC-INACTIV-EXIT.
           EXIT.

      ******************************************************************
       2000-PROC-PROGRAMA.
      ******************************************************************
           MOVE '2000-PROC-PROGRAMA'       TO VIAL0015-CALLER-ID.
           IF AQCW0100-AT-DEBUG-SIM
              PERFORM VIAP0015-TRATA-DEBUG
                 THRU VIAP0015-TRATA-DEBUG-EXIT
           END-IF.

           MOVE ZEROS                      TO WS-TOTAL-RECONC.

           PERFORM 2100-OPEN-CURSOR
              THRU 2100-OPEN-CURSOR-EXIT.

           SET  SW-PRVALBOL-NOTOK          TO TRUE.

           PERFORM 2200-FETCH-CURSOR
              THRU 2200-FETCH-CURSOR-EXIT
             UNTIL NOT AQCW0009-SEM-ERROS
                OR NOT WS-CURSOR-OK
                OR SW-PRVALBOL-OK.

           PERFORM 2300-PROCESSA-CURSOR
              THRU 2300-PROCESSA-CURSOR-EXIT
             UNTIL NOT WS-CURSOR-OK
                OR NOT AQCW0009-SEM-ERROS.

           IF  AQCW0009-SEM-ERROS
           AND WS-TOTAL-RECONC     GREATER 1
               PERFORM 1120-FORCA-SEQ-RECONC
                  THRU 1120-FORCA-SEQ-RECONC-EXIT
           END-IF.

           PERFORM 2700-CLOSE-CURSOR
              THRU 2700-CLOSE-CURSOR-EXIT.

       2000-PROC-PROGRAMA-EXIT.
           EXIT.

      ******************************************************************
       2100-OPEN-CURSOR.
      ******************************************************************
           MOVE '2100-OPEN-CURSOR'         TO VIAL0015-CALLER-ID.
           IF VIAL0015-DEBUG-SIM
              PERFORM VIAP0015-TRATA-DEBUG
                 THRU VIAP0015-TRATA-DEBUG-EXIT
           END-IF.

           SET WS-CURSOR-OK                TO TRUE.

           MOVE SPACES                     TO SWCD7204-MREANL.

           MOVE CON-SWVT7204               TO AQCW0011-TABLE-NAME.

           EXEC SQL
              OPEN CRS_SWVT72
           END-EXEC.

           PERFORM 9020-DB2CHECK
              THRU 9029-DB2CHECK-EXIT.

           EVALUATE TRUE
              WHEN AQCW0011-OK
                 CONTINUE
              WHEN OTHER
                 SET  AQCW0009-RCODE-APL   TO TRUE
                 SET  VIAW0030-DB2-ERROR   TO TRUE
                 MOVE WS-PROGNAME          TO VIAW0030-PGMNAME
                 MOVE VIAL0015-CALLER-ID   TO VIAW0030-PARAGRAPH-NAME
                 MOVE AQCW0011-TABLE-NAME  TO VIAW0030-TABLE-NAME
                 MOVE AQCW0011-SQLCODE     TO VIAW0030-SQLCODE
                 MOVE 'ERRO OPEN DO CURSOR'
                                           TO VIAW0030-DESC1
              PERFORM VIAP0030-ESCREVE-SPOOL
                 THRU VIAP0030-ESCREVE-SPOOL-EXIT
           END-EVALUATE.

       2100-OPEN-CURSOR-EXIT.
           EXIT.

      ******************************************************************
       2200-FETCH-CURSOR.
      ******************************************************************
           MOVE '2200-FETCH-CURSOR'        TO VIAL0015-CALLER-ID.
           IF VIAL0015-DEBUG-SIM
              PERFORM VIAP0015-TRATA-DEBUG
                 THRU VIAP0015-TRATA-DEBUG-EXIT
           END-IF.

           MOVE CON-SWVT7204               TO AQCW0011-TABLE-NAME.

           EXEC SQL
              FETCH CRS_SWVT72
               INTO :SWCD7204-MRBALC
                  , :SWCD7204-MRCCB
                  , :SWCD7204-NCCCCBAN
                  , :SWCD7204-NCCCCSPAI
                  , :SWCD7204-MRVLR
                  , :SWCD7204-MRDATL
                  , :SWCD7204-MRNOPR
                  , :SWCD7204-MRNORD
                  , :SWCD7204-MREANL
                  , :SWCD7204-MRMOED
           END-EXEC.

           PERFORM 9020-DB2CHECK
              THRU 9029-DB2CHECK-EXIT.

           EVALUATE TRUE
              WHEN AQCW0011-OK
                 EVALUATE TRUE
                    WHEN SWCD7204-NCCCCBAN    NOT EQUAL WS-CBAN
                    WHEN SWCD7204-NCCCCSPAI   NOT EQUAL WS-CSPAI
                    WHEN SWCD7204-MRMOED      NOT EQUAL WS-CMOED
                       PERFORM 2210-OBTER-PARAM
                          THRU 2219-OBTER-PARAM-EXIT
                    WHEN OTHER
                       MOVE WS-PRVALBOL    TO SW-PRVALBOL-STATUS
                 END-EVALUATE

              WHEN AQCW0011-NOTFND
                 SET WS-CURSOR-END         TO TRUE
              WHEN OTHER
                 SET  AQCW0009-RCODE-APL   TO TRUE
                 SET  VIAW0030-DB2-ERROR   TO TRUE
                 MOVE WS-PROGNAME          TO VIAW0030-PGMNAME
                 MOVE VIAL0015-CALLER-ID   TO VIAW0030-PARAGRAPH-NAME
                 MOVE AQCW0011-TABLE-NAME  TO VIAW0030-TABLE-NAME
                 MOVE AQCW0011-SQLCODE     TO VIAW0030-SQLCODE
                 MOVE 'ERRO NA LEITURA DO CURSOR'
                                           TO VIAW0030-DESC1
                 PERFORM VIAP0030-ESCREVE-SPOOL
                    THRU VIAP0030-ESCREVE-SPOOL-EXIT
           END-EVALUATE.

       2200-FETCH-CURSOR-EXIT.
           EXIT.

      ******************************************************************
       2210-OBTER-PARAM.
      ******************************************************************
           MOVE '2210-OBTER-PARAM'         TO VIAL0015-CALLER-ID
           IF AQCW0100-AT-DEBUG-SIM
              PERFORM VIAP0015-TRATA-DEBUG
                 THRU VIAP0015-TRATA-DEBUG-EXIT
           END-IF.

           INITIALIZE DCLSWPARAM           REPLACING NUMERIC BY ZEROES
                                                ALPHANUMERIC BY SPACES.

           MOVE SWCD7204-NCCCCBAN          TO WS-CBAN.
           MOVE SWCD7204-NCCCCSPAI         TO WS-CSPAI.
           MOVE SWCD7204-MRMOED            TO WS-CMOED.

           MOVE SWCK0002-CAPLIC            TO SWPARAM-PRCODPAR.
           MOVE WS-PRPARAM                 TO SWPARAM-PRPARAM.

           EXEC SQL
              SELECT PRVALBOL
                INTO :SWPARAM-PRVALBOL
                FROM SWPARAM
               WHERE PRCODPAR  =  :SWPARAM-PRCODPAR
                 AND PRPARAM   =  :SWPARAM-PRPARAM
           END-EXEC.

           MOVE CON-SWPARAM                TO AQCW0011-TABLE-NAME.

           PERFORM 9020-DB2CHECK
              THRU 9029-DB2CHECK-EXIT.

           EVALUATE TRUE
              WHEN AQCW0011-OK
                 MOVE SWPARAM-PRVALBOL     TO SW-PRVALBOL-STATUS
                                              WS-PRVALBOL
              WHEN AQCW0011-NOTFND
                 SET  SW-PRVALBOL-NOTOK    TO TRUE
              WHEN OTHER
                 SET  AQCW0009-RCODE-APL
                      VIAW0030-DB2-ERROR   TO TRUE
                 MOVE WS-PROGNAME          TO VIAW0030-PGMNAME
                 MOVE VIAL0015-CALLER-ID   TO VIAW0030-PARAGRAPH-NAME
                 MOVE AQCW0011-TABLE-NAME  TO VIAW0030-TABLE-NAME
                 MOVE AQCW0011-SQLCODE     TO VIAW0030-SQLCODE
                 MOVE 'Erro SELECT'        TO VIAW0030-DESC1
                 PERFORM VIAP0030-ESCREVE-SPOOL
                    THRU VIAP0030-ESCREVE-SPOOL-EXIT
           END-EVALUATE.

       2219-OBTER-PARAM-EXIT.
           EXIT.

      ******************************************************************
       2300-PROCESSA-CURSOR.
      ******************************************************************
           MOVE '2300-PROCESSA-CURSOR'     TO VIAL0015-CALLER-ID.
           IF VIAL0015-DEBUG-SIM
              PERFORM VIAP0015-TRATA-DEBUG
                 THRU VIAP0015-TRATA-DEBUG-EXIT
           END-IF.

           SET  SW-SELECT-NOTOK            TO TRUE
           SET  SW-RECONC-OPER-NAO         TO TRUE.
           MOVE ZEROS                      TO WS-TOTAL
                                              WS-COUNT
                                              WS-TOTAL-EXTR
                                              WS-COUNT-EXTR
                                              WS-TOTAL-MOVIM
                                              WS-COUNT-MOVIM

           PERFORM 2310-PROCURAR-ESTORNO
              THRU 2319-PROCURAR-ESTORNO-EXIT.

           EVALUATE TRUE
              WHEN NOT AQCW0009-SEM-ERROS
              WHEN SW-SELECT-NOTOK
                 CONTINUE
              WHEN SW-SELECT-OK
                 MOVE WS-IDRECONC          TO WS-IDREC
                 PERFORM 2320-ASSOCIAR-MOVIMENTOS
                    THRU 2329-ASSOCIAR-MOVIMENTOS-EXIT

                 IF AQCW0009-SEM-ERROS
                    PERFORM 2400-REGISTA-SWVT8200
                       THRU 2400-REGISTA-SWVT8200-EXIT
                 END-IF

                 IF AQCW0009-SEM-ERROS
                    SET SW-RECONC-OPER     TO TRUE
                 END-IF
           END-EVALUATE.

           SET  SW-PRVALBOL-NOTOK          TO TRUE.

           IF AQCW0009-SEM-ERROS AND SW-RECONC-OPER
              ADD 1                        TO WS-IDRECONC-SEQ
              ADD 1                        TO WS-TOTAL-RECONC
              PERFORM 8100-COMMIT-CONTROL
                 THRU 8199-COMMIT-CONTROL-EXIT
           END-IF.

           PERFORM 2200-FETCH-CURSOR
              THRU 2200-FETCH-CURSOR-EXIT
             UNTIL NOT AQCW0009-SEM-ERROS
                OR NOT WS-CURSOR-OK
                OR SW-PRVALBOL-OK.

       2300-PROCESSA-CURSOR-EXIT.
           EXIT.

      ******************************************************************
       2310-PROCURAR-ESTORNO.
      ******************************************************************
           MOVE '2310-PROCURAR-ESTORNO'    TO VIAL0015-CALLER-ID.
           IF VIAL0015-DEBUG-SIM
              PERFORM VIAP0015-TRATA-DEBUG
                 THRU VIAP0015-TRATA-DEBUG-EXIT
           END-IF.

           MOVE SWCD7204-MRBALC            TO WS-SWT72-MRBALC.
           MOVE SWCD7204-MRCCB             TO WS-SWT72-MRCCB.
           MOVE SWCD7204-MRNOPR            TO WS-SWT72-MRNOPR.
           MULTIPLY -1 BY SWCD7204-MRVLR
                                       GIVING WS-SWT72-MRVLR.
           MOVE SWCD7204-MREANL            TO WS-SWT72-MREANL.

           EXEC SQL
              SELECT MRNORD
                INTO :WS-SWT72-MRNORD
                FROM SWVT7204
               WHERE MRBALC    =  :WS-SWT72-MRBALC
                 AND MRCCB     =  :WS-SWT72-MRCCB
                 AND MRNOPR    =  :WS-SWT72-MRNOPR
                 AND MRVLR     =  :WS-SWT72-MRVLR
PML24            AND CCODEST   = :CON-PEND
                 AND MREANL    =  :WS-SWT72-MREANL
               FETCH FIRST ROW ONLY
           END-EXEC.

           MOVE CON-SWVT7204               TO AQCW0011-TABLE-NAME.

           PERFORM 9020-DB2CHECK
              THRU 9029-DB2CHECK-EXIT.

           EVALUATE TRUE
              WHEN AQCW0011-NOTFND
                 CONTINUE
              WHEN AQCW0011-OK
                 SET  SW-SELECT-OK         TO TRUE
              WHEN OTHER
                 SET  AQCW0009-RCODE-APL
                      VIAW0030-DB2-ERROR   TO TRUE
                 MOVE WS-PROGNAME          TO VIAW0030-PGMNAME
                 MOVE VIAL0015-CALLER-ID   TO VIAW0030-PARAGRAPH-NAME
                 MOVE AQCW0011-TABLE-NAME  TO VIAW0030-TABLE-NAME
                 MOVE AQCW0011-SQLCODE     TO VIAW0030-SQLCODE
                 MOVE 'Erro SELECT'        TO VIAW0030-DESC1
                 PERFORM VIAP0030-ESCREVE-SPOOL
                    THRU VIAP0030-ESCREVE-SPOOL-EXIT
           END-EVALUATE.

       2319-PROCURAR-ESTORNO-EXIT.
            EXIT.

      ******************************************************************
       2320-ASSOCIAR-MOVIMENTOS.
      ******************************************************************
           MOVE '2320-ASSOCIAR-MOVIMENTOS' TO VIAL0015-CALLER-ID.
           IF VIAL0015-DEBUG-SIM
              PERFORM VIAP0015-TRATA-DEBUG
                 THRU VIAP0015-TRATA-DEBUG-EXIT
           END-IF.

AG    *    PERFORM 2321-REGISTAR-ASSOCIACAO
AG    *       THRU 2321-REGISTAR-ASSOCIACAO-EXIT.

           IF AQCW0009-SEM-ERROS
              PERFORM 2322-RECONCILIAR-BASE
                 THRU 2322-RECONCILIAR-BASE-EXIT
           END-IF.

           IF AQCW0009-SEM-ERROS
              PERFORM 2323-RECONCILIAR-ASSOC
                 THRU 2323-RECONCILIAR-ASSOC-EXIT
           END-IF.

       2329-ASSOCIAR-MOVIMENTOS-EXIT.
           EXIT.

AG    ******************************************************************
|     *2321-REGISTAR-ASSOCIACAO.
|     ******************************************************************
|     *
|     *    MOVE '2321-REGISTAR-ASSOCIACAO' TO VIAL0015-CALLER-ID.
|     *
|     *    IF VIAL0015-DEBUG-SIM
|     *       PERFORM VIAP0015-TRATA-DEBUG
|     *          THRU VIAP0015-TRATA-DEBUG-EXIT
|     *    END-IF.
|     *
|     *    MOVE SWCD7204-MRNOPR            TO SWCD8001-MRNOPR.
|     *    MOVE SWCD7204-MRNORD            TO SWCD8001-MRNORD.
|     *    MOVE WS-SWT72-MRNOPR            TO SWCD8001-NOPRREC.
|     *    MOVE WS-SWT72-MRNORD            TO SWCD8001-NORDREC.
|     *    MOVE AQCW0100-AT-DTOP           TO AQCW0005-DT98.
|     *    PERFORM AQCP0005-CONV-DT8INDT10
|     *       THRU AQCP0005-CONV-DT8INDT10-EXIT.
|     *    MOVE AQCW0005-DTX10             TO SWCD8001-DATREC.
|     *    MOVE WS-PROGNAME                TO SWCD8001-CUSERID.
|     *
|     *    MOVE CON-SWVT8001               TO AQCW0011-TABLE-NAME.
|     *
|     *    EXEC SQL
|     *       INSERT
|     *         INTO SWVT8001 (
|     *              MRNOPR
|     *            , MRNORD
|     *            , NOPRREC
|     *            , NORDREC
|     *            , DATREC
|     *            , CUSERID
|     *            , HTIMEST
|     *         )
|     *       VALUES (
|     *              :SWCD8001-MRNOPR
|     *            , :SWCD8001-MRNORD
|     *            , :SWCD8001-NOPRREC
|     *            , :SWCD8001-NORDREC
|     *            , :SWCD8001-DATREC
|     *            , :SWCD8001-CUSERID
|     *            , CURRENT TIMESTAMP
|     *         )
|     *    END-EXEC.
|     *
|     *    PERFORM 9020-DB2CHECK
|     *       THRU 9029-DB2CHECK-EXIT.
|     *
|     *    EVALUATE TRUE
|     *       WHEN AQCW0011-OK
|     *          CONTINUE
|     *       WHEN OTHER
|     *          SET  AQCW0009-RCODE-APL   TO TRUE
|     *          SET  VIAW0030-DB2-ERROR   TO TRUE
|     *          MOVE WS-PROGNAME          TO VIAW0030-PGMNAME
|     *          MOVE VIAL0015-CALLER-ID   TO VIAW0030-PARAGRAPH-NAME
|     *          MOVE AQCW0011-TABLE-NAME  TO VIAW0030-TABLE-NAME
|     *          MOVE AQCW0011-SQLCODE     TO VIAW0030-SQLCODE
|     *          MOVE 'ERRO NO INSERT NA TABELA'
|     *                                    TO VIAW0030-DESC1
|     *          PERFORM VIAP0030-ESCREVE-SPOOL
|     *             THRU VIAP0030-ESCREVE-SPOOL-EXIT
|     *    END-EVALUATE.
|     *
|     *2321-REGISTAR-ASSOCIACAO-EXIT.
AG    *    EXIT.

      ******************************************************************
       2322-RECONCILIAR-BASE.
      ******************************************************************
           MOVE '2322-RECONCILIAR-BASE'    TO VIAL0015-CALLER-ID.
           IF VIAL0015-DEBUG-SIM
              PERFORM VIAP0015-TRATA-DEBUG
                 THRU VIAP0015-TRATA-DEBUG-EXIT
           END-IF.

           MOVE WS-PROGNAME                TO SWCD7204-CUSERID.
AG    *    MOVE SWCK0002-RECONC-1-PARA-1   TO SWCD7204-CNATREC.
AG         MOVE SWCK0002-RECONC-N-PARA-0   TO SWCD7204-CNATREC.
           MOVE SWCK0002-RECONCILIADO      TO SWCD7204-CCODEST
           MOVE SWCK0002-RECONC-AUTOMATICA TO SWCD7204-CTIPREC
           MOVE WS-IDREC                   TO SWCD7204-IDRECONC
           MOVE CON-ON0                    TO SWCD7204-CNIVREC

           MOVE CON-SWVT7204               TO AQCW0011-TABLE-NAME.

           EXEC SQL
              UPDATE SWVT7204
                 SET CUSERID  =  :SWCD7204-CUSERID
                   , HTIMEST  =  CURRENT TIMESTAMP
                   , CCODEST  =  :SWCD7204-CCODEST
                   , IDRECONC =  :SWCD7204-IDRECONC
                   , CNATREC  =  :SWCD7204-CNATREC
                   , CTIPREC  =  :SWCD7204-CTIPREC
                   , CNIVREC  =  :SWCD7204-CNIVREC
               WHERE MRNOPR   =  :SWCD7204-MRNOPR
                 AND MRNORD   =  :SWCD7204-MRNORD
           END-EXEC.

           PERFORM 9020-DB2CHECK
              THRU 9029-DB2CHECK-EXIT.

           EVALUATE TRUE
              WHEN AQCW0011-OK
                 CONTINUE
              WHEN OTHER
                 SET  AQCW0009-RCODE-APL   TO TRUE
                 SET  VIAW0030-DB2-ERROR   TO TRUE
                 MOVE WS-PROGNAME          TO VIAW0030-PGMNAME
                 MOVE VIAL0015-CALLER-ID   TO VIAW0030-PARAGRAPH-NAME
                 MOVE AQCW0011-TABLE-NAME  TO VIAW0030-TABLE-NAME
                 MOVE AQCW0011-SQLCODE     TO VIAW0030-SQLCODE
                 MOVE 'ERRO NO UPDATE DA TABELA SWT72 1'
                                           TO VIAW0030-DESC1
                 PERFORM VIAP0030-ESCREVE-SPOOL
                    THRU VIAP0030-ESCREVE-SPOOL-EXIT
           END-EVALUATE.

       2322-RECONCILIAR-BASE-EXIT.
           EXIT.

      ******************************************************************
       2323-RECONCILIAR-ASSOC.
      ******************************************************************
           MOVE '2323-RECONCILIAR-ASSOC'   TO VIAL0015-CALLER-ID.
           IF VIAL0015-DEBUG-SIM
              PERFORM VIAP0015-TRATA-DEBUG
                 THRU VIAP0015-TRATA-DEBUG-EXIT
           END-IF.

           MOVE WS-PROGNAME                TO SWCD7204-CUSERID.
AG    *    MOVE SWCK0002-RECONC-1-PARA-1   TO SWCD7204-CNATREC.
AG         MOVE SWCK0002-RECONC-N-PARA-0   TO SWCD7204-CNATREC.
           MOVE SWCK0002-RECONCILIADO      TO SWCD7204-CCODEST
           MOVE SWCK0002-RECONC-AUTOMATICA TO SWCD7204-CTIPREC.
           MOVE WS-IDREC                   TO SWCD7204-IDRECONC.
           MOVE CON-ON0                    TO SWCD7204-CNIVREC.

           MOVE CON-SWVT7204               TO AQCW0011-TABLE-NAME.

           EXEC SQL
              UPDATE SWVT7204
                 SET CUSERID  =  :SWCD7204-CUSERID
                   , HTIMEST  =  CURRENT TIMESTAMP
                   , CCODEST  =  :SWCD7204-CCODEST
                   , IDRECONC =  :SWCD7204-IDRECONC
                   , CNATREC  =  :SWCD7204-CNATREC
                   , CTIPREC  =  :SWCD7204-CTIPREC
                   , CNIVREC  =  :SWCD7204-CNIVREC
               WHERE MRNOPR   =  :WS-SWT72-MRNOPR
                 AND MRNORD   =  :WS-SWT72-MRNORD
           END-EXEC.

           PERFORM 9020-DB2CHECK
              THRU 9029-DB2CHECK-EXIT.

           EVALUATE TRUE
              WHEN AQCW0011-OK
                 CONTINUE
              WHEN OTHER
                 SET  AQCW0009-RCODE-APL   TO TRUE
                 SET  VIAW0030-DB2-ERROR   TO TRUE
                 MOVE WS-PROGNAME          TO VIAW0030-PGMNAME
                 MOVE VIAL0015-CALLER-ID   TO VIAW0030-PARAGRAPH-NAME
                 MOVE AQCW0011-TABLE-NAME  TO VIAW0030-TABLE-NAME
                 MOVE AQCW0011-SQLCODE     TO VIAW0030-SQLCODE
                 MOVE 'ERRO NO UPDATE DA TABELA SWT72 2'
                                           TO VIAW0030-DESC1
                 PERFORM VIAP0030-ESCREVE-SPOOL
                    THRU VIAP0030-ESCREVE-SPOOL-EXIT
           END-EVALUATE.

       2323-RECONCILIAR-ASSOC-EXIT.
           EXIT.

      ******************************************************************
       2400-REGISTA-SWVT8200.
      ******************************************************************
           MOVE '2400-REGISTA-SWVT8200'    TO VIAL0015-CALLER-ID.
           IF VIAL0015-DEBUG-SIM
              PERFORM VIAP0015-TRATA-DEBUG
                 THRU VIAP0015-TRATA-DEBUG-EXIT
           END-IF.

           MOVE AQCW0100-AT-DTOP           TO AQCW0005-DT98.
           PERFORM AQCP0005-CONV-DT8INDT10
              THRU AQCP0005-CONV-DT8INDT10-EXIT.
           MOVE AQCW0005-DTX10             TO SWCD8201-DATREC.
           MOVE WS-PROGNAME                TO SWCD8201-CUSERID.

           MOVE CON-SWVT8201               TO AQCW0011-TABLE-NAME.

           EXEC SQL
              INSERT INTO SWVT8201
                   ( IDRECONC
                   , NSEQ
                   , MRNOPR
                   , MRNORD
                   , COSN
                   , COSNC
                   , DATREC
                   , CUSERID
                   , HTIMEST
                   )
                   SELECT
                       B.IDRECONC
                     , ROW_NUMBER() OVER (ORDER BY B.IDRECONC)
                     , B.MRNOPR
                     , B.MRNORD
                     , ""
                     , ""
                     , :SWCD8201-DATREC
                     , :SWCD8201-CUSERID
                     , CURRENT_TIMESTAMP
                  FROM SWVT7204 B
                 WHERE B.IDRECONC  = :WS-IDREC
           END-EXEC.

           PERFORM 9020-DB2CHECK
              THRU 9029-DB2CHECK-EXIT.

           EVALUATE TRUE
              WHEN AQCW0011-OK
                 CONTINUE
              WHEN OTHER
                 SET  AQCW0009-RCODE-APL   TO TRUE
                 SET  VIAW0030-DB2-ERROR   TO TRUE
                 MOVE WS-PROGNAME          TO VIAW0030-PGMNAME
                 MOVE VIAL0015-CALLER-ID   TO VIAW0030-PARAGRAPH-NAME
                 MOVE AQCW0011-TABLE-NAME  TO VIAW0030-TABLE-NAME
                 MOVE AQCW0011-SQLCODE     TO VIAW0030-SQLCODE
                 MOVE 'ERRO NO INSERT NA TABELA SWT82'
                                           TO VIAW0030-DESC1
                 PERFORM VIAP0030-ESCREVE-SPOOL
                    THRU VIAP0030-ESCREVE-SPOOL-EXIT
           END-EVALUATE.

       2400-REGISTA-SWVT8200-EXIT.
           EXIT.

      ******************************************************************
       2700-CLOSE-CURSOR.
      ******************************************************************
           MOVE '2700-CLOSE-CURSOR'        TO VIAL0015-CALLER-ID.
           IF VIAL0015-DEBUG-SIM
              PERFORM VIAP0015-TRATA-DEBUG
                 THRU VIAP0015-TRATA-DEBUG-EXIT
           END-IF.

           MOVE CON-SWVT7204               TO AQCW0011-TABLE-NAME.

           EXEC SQL
              CLOSE CRS_SWVT7204
           END-EXEC.

       2700-CLOSE-CURSOR-EXIT.
           EXIT.

      ******************************************************************
       3000-FIM-PROGRAMA.
      ******************************************************************
           MOVE '3000-FIM-PROGRAMA'        TO VIAL0015-CALLER-ID.
           IF VIAL0015-DEBUG-SIM
              PERFORM VIAP0015-TRATA-DEBUG
                 THRU VIAP0015-TRATA-DEBUG-EXIT
           END-IF.

AG         IF AQCW0009-SEM-ERROS
|             PERFORM 1120-FORCA-SEQ-RECONC
|                THRU 1120-FORCA-SEQ-RECONC-EXIT
AG         END-IF.

           IF AQCW0009-SEM-ERROS
              PERFORM AQCP0100-REG-FIM
                 THRU AQCP0100-REG-FIM-EXIT
           END-IF.

           PERFORM AQCP0002-TRATA-SYNCPOINT
              THRU AQCP0002-TRATA-SYNCPOINT-EXIT.

       3000-FIM-PROGRAMA-EXIT.
           EXIT.

      ******************************************************************
       8000-GET-COMMIT.
      ******************************************************************
           MOVE '8000-GET-COMMIT'          TO VIAL0015-CALLER-ID.
           IF AQCW0100-AT-DEBUG-SIM
              PERFORM VIAP0015-TRATA-DEBUG
                 THRU VIAP0015-TRATA-DEBUG-EXIT
           END-IF.

           INITIALIZE ARCL5072-DATA
                      ETCL0002-COMMAREA    REPLACING NUMERIC BY ZEROES
                                                ALPHANUMERIC BY SPACES.

           PERFORM ETCP0003-STD-INIT
              THRU ETCP0003-STD-INIT-EXIT.

           MOVE WS-PROGNAME                TO ARCL5072-I-CPROCESSO.

           PERFORM CALL-ARM5072
              THRU CALL-ARM5072-EXIT.

           PERFORM ETCP0003-STD-END
              THRU ETCP0003-STD-END-EXIT.

           MOVE VIAW0020-RCODE             TO AQCW0009-RCODE.

           IF AQCW0009-SEM-ERROS
              MOVE ARCL5072-O-NCOMMITINT   TO WS-COMMIT-LIMIT
           END-IF.

       8099-GET-COMMIT-EXIT.
           EXIT.

      ******************************************************************
       8100-COMMIT-CONTROL.
      ******************************************************************
           MOVE '8100-COMMIT-CONTROL'      TO VIAL0015-CALLER-ID.
           IF AQCW0100-AT-DEBUG-SIM
              PERFORM VIAP0015-TRATA-DEBUG
                 THRU VIAP0015-TRATA-DEBUG-EXIT
           END-IF.

           ADD  +1                         TO WS-COMMIT-COUNT.

           IF WS-COMMIT-COUNT > WS-COMMIT-LIMIT
              PERFORM 1120-FORCA-SEQ-RECONC
                 THRU 1120-FORCA-SEQ-RECONC-EXIT

              PERFORM AQCP0002-TRATA-SYNCPOINT
                 THRU AQCP0002-TRATA-SYNCPOINT-EXIT

              MOVE ZEROES                  TO WS-COMMIT-COUNT
           END-IF.

       8199-COMMIT-CONTROL-EXIT.
           EXIT.

      ******************************************************************
           EXEC SQL INCLUDE AQCP0002 END-EXEC.
      ******************************************************************
           COPY VIAP0011.
           COPY VIAP0015.
           COPY VIAP0030.
           COPY AQCP0011.
           COPY AQCP0109.
           COPY ETCP1000.
           COPY ETCR9203.
           COPY ARCP5072.
